1359		This formalization-only definition presents a POVM placed on one factor of a
1360		bipartite space as a POVM on that space. For a measurement $\{M_a\}_a$ on the
1361		first factor the placed effects are $M_a \ot \Id$; for a measurement on the
1362		second factor they are $\Id \ot M_a$. In both cases the effects are positive
1363		and sum to the identity of the bipartite space, so the comparisons of
1364		Lemma~\ref{lem:pasting}, whose two sides are placed families, are comparisons
1365		of measurements and the consistency calculus applies to them.

